---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#061014" />
    <title>attribution / cristian's scratchpad</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Attributions and licenses for cristian's scratchpad."
    />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link
      rel="icon"
      type="image/png"
      sizes="48x48"
      href="/favicon-rick-sanchez-48-35bb6309.png"
    />
    <link
      rel="apple-touch-icon"
      sizes="480x480"
      href="/apple-touch-icon-rick-sanchez-480-888209cd.png"
    />
    <style>
      .attribution {
        width: min(820px, calc(100% - 48px));
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 48px 0 80px;
      }

      .attribution .back {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 14px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
      }

      .attribution pre {
        margin-top: 48px;
        color: var(--text);
        font: 19px/1.65 "Perfect DOS", "Courier New", monospace;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
      }

      .attribution a {
        color: var(--link);
        border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
      }

      .attribution a:hover,
      .attribution a:focus-visible {
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .attribution .raw {
        margin-top: 48px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 560px) {
        .attribution {
          width: calc(100% - 32px);
          padding-top: 32px;
        }

        .attribution pre {
          font-size: 17px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body class="nightlab">
    <main class="attribution">
      <a class="back" href="/">cristian's scratchpad</a>

      <pre>attribution

Favicon
Rick Sanchez icon by <a href="https://icons8.com/icon/57324/rick-sanchez" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Icons8</a>
Icons8 license: <a href="https://icons8.com/license" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://icons8.com/license</a>

The Icons8 license covers the icon asset. Rick Sanchez is a
character from Rick and Morty. Character rights remain with
their respective owners.

Fonts
Doto by the Doto Project Authors. SIL Open Font License 1.1.
<a href="/fonts/OFL-Doto.txt">Local license file</a>

Perfect DOS VGA 437 by Zeh Fernando. Free for personal use.
<a href="https://github.com/CP437/PerfectDOSVGA437" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source</a>

Software
Astro (MIT): <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://astro.build</a>
KaTeX (MIT): <a href="https://katex.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://katex.org</a></pre>

      <p class="raw">
        <a href="/attributions.txt">plain text version</a>
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
